                <note rend="inline" type="source">123 W 451/164: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Cuba</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Matthews</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Acting Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1933-12-13T15:00:00-05:00">December 13, 1933—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 4:20 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>515. Ambassador Welles departed by airplane this afternoon.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Matthews</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
